{"title":"Career Roadmap · Fashion Merchandiser","role":"Fashion Merchandiser","summary":"A Fashion Merchandiser connects design, product development, sourcing, production, quality, costing and customers to ensure that the right products are developed and delivered at the right price, quality and time.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc Fashion Technology / Textile Science"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong career alignment for Fashion Technology/Textile Science graduates because the degree provides knowledge of fabrics, garment construction, textiles, production processes and quality, while merchandising adds commercial and coordination skills."},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"Fresh graduates generally enter as Merchandising Trainee, Assistant Merchandiser or Junior Merchandiser. Senior Merchandiser, Merchandising Manager and Buying roles are progression positions."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Student / Merchandising Intern"},{"text":"Textiles, garments, costing and communication"}],[{"text":"2027–2029"},{"text":"Merchandising Trainee / Assistant Merchandiser"},{"text":"Sampling, buyer communication, production follow-up"}],[{"text":"2029–2032"},{"text":"Merchandiser"},{"text":"End-to-end order management"}],[{"text":"2032–2036"},{"text":"Senior Merchandiser / Account Merchandiser"},{"text":"Major buyers and product categories"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Merchandising Manager / Buying Manager"},{"text":"Teams, accounts and sourcing strategy"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Head of Merchandising / Sourcing Director"},{"text":"Global sourcing, commercial and product strategy"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does a Fashion Merchandiser Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A merchandiser manages the process fro